      "statement": "FeedFetcher caps the fetched body at DEFAULT_MAX_FEED_BYTES (10 MiB) by reading maxFeedBytes+1 bytes and throwing FeedFetchException if the body exceeds that cap, bounding heap usage for both feed and reader-view fetches.",
